    },
    "body": "* Use a mutex to avoid potentially returning a non-immortalized string, because immortalization happens after the insertion into the interned dict.\r\n\r\n* Use `Py_DECREF()` calls instead of `Py_SET_REFCNT(s, Py_REFCNT(s) - 2)` for thread-safety. This code path isn't performance sensitive, so just use `Py_DECREF()` unconditionally for simplicity.\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- gh-issue-number: gh-129701 -->\r\n* Issue: gh-129701\r\n<!-- /gh-issue-number -->\r\n",
